subheader" style="text-align: center;">Email your thoughts&nbsp;or come see us in person.</h2></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-2887b97c-a5bd-4188-be5e-c80a539d5387" class="wsb-element-customform" data-type="element"> <div class="form customform form-row allow-select" data-aid="elm-container-2887b97c-a5bd-4188-be5e-c80a539d5387"><div data-label-container-groupid="1-desktop"><label class="form-label" for="elm-2887b97c-a5bd-4188-be5e-c80a539d5387"> Email: <span class="form-req">*</span></label></div><div data-field-container-groupid="1-desktop"><input type="email" id="elm-2887b97c-a5bd-4188-be5e-c80a539d5387" data-groupid="1-desktop" name="elm-2887b97c-a5bd-4188-be5e-c80a539d5387" data-label="Email:" data-formtype="email" data-gemsubmit="true" class="form-value" data-content="" placeholder="Enter email address" required="true"><label class="form-label opt-in-label"><input type="checkbox" class="opt-in-checkbox"><span class="opt-in">Check here to receive email updates</span></label></div></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-15f0ebf8-fa08-4922-be9d-48fa60dd117c" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p><span style="font-size: 14px;"></span>The Kennedy-King neighborhood is comprised of 16th Street to the south, 22nd Street to the north, the Monon Trail to the east, and Central Avenue to the west.<span style="font-size: 14px;"></span></p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-c211f7f9-e732-4a9c-9047-b61e3c44f943" class="wsb-element-image" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-image-inner "><div class="img"><a href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kennedykingnbhd.org/home.html"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 home.html}}" rel=""><img src="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nebula.wsimg.com/3d0138249a49034279a139859c79485d?AccessKeyId=531592D248B589D87A56&disposition=0&alloworigin=1"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 //nebula.wsimg.com/3d0138249a49034279a139859c79485d?AccessKeyId=531592D248B589D87A56&amp;disposition=0&amp;alloworigin=1}}"